{"id":"or6utq3zo74r12u7bio8l2018","title":"埃文斯坎价值分红基金分红增加，表现优于同行","originalTitle":"EVT: Paying Even Bigger Distributions From Value-Oriented Equity Holdings","summary":"埃文斯坎税优分红收入基金（EVT）分红增加15%，交易折价9.8%，收益率达8.3%。该基金的价值导向股票组合在过去一年中跑赢标普500指数两倍，长期平均年回报率为12%。基金避免重仓科技股，受益于价值股市场的轮动，被推荐为收入导向投资组合的核心持仓。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha"},"links":{"original":"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4967162-evt-paying-bigger-distributions-from-value-oriented-equity-holdings?source=feed_all_articles"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T17:14:38.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T17:19:22.358Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T17:19:22.358Z","category":"stock-us","tags":["财报","研究报告"],"score":46,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}